Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.79,0:00:02.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.79,0:00:02.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.29,0:00:05.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The X Tens are online.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.29,0:00:05.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}X10上线了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.46,0:00:11.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gentlemen, I am now about to send a signal from this laptop through our local ISP...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.46,0:00:11.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 我现在要从这台电脑发出信号 通过本地ISP…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.59,0:00:15.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...racing down fiber-optic cable at the speed of light to San Francisco...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.59,0:00:15.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}经由光纤电缆 以光速直达旧金山…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.22,0:00:18.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...bouncing off a satellite in geosynchronous orbit to Lisbon, Portugal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.22,0:00:18.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再经由地球同步人造卫星的反射 到达葡萄牙的里斯本
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.73,0:00:21.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Data packets will be handed off to submerged transatlantic cables...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.73,0:00:21.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}数据包会经由跨大西洋海底电缆…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:23.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...terminating in Halifax, Nova Scotia...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:23.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}送到新斯科舍省的哈利法克斯…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.11,0:00:27.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and transferred across the continent via microwave relays back to our ISP...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.11,0:00:27.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跨越整个大陆 然后经由微波通信 传回我们的ISP…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.94,0:00:30.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and the external receiver attached to this...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.94,0:00:30.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最后传回接在…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.16,0:00:32.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.16,0:00:32.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个台灯的接收器上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.03,0:00:37.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at me, look at me, I've got goose bumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.03,0:00:37.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看我…我都起了鸡皮疙瘩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.37,0:00:40.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Are we ready on the stereo? -Go for stereo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.37,0:00:40.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-可以放音乐了吗？ -放吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.21,0:00:42.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[MOUSE CLICKS]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.42,0:00:45.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[2001: A SPACE ODYSSEY'S "MAIN TITLE" PLAYS OVER SPEAKERS]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.38,0:00:50.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LEONARD HUMMING]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.80,0:00:53.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[ALL HUMMING]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.35,0:00:57.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[ALL IMITATING DRUMS]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.85,0:01:04.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, guys. LEONARD &amp; SHELDON: Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.85,0:01:04.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嗨 各位 -你好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.86,0:01:06.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a little loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.86,0:01:06.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们音乐有点大声
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.32,0:01:08.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No problem. Turning it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.32,0:01:08.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没问题 我们马上把音乐关小
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.69,0:01:11.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}San Francisco, Lisbon, Halifax:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.69,0:01:11.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}旧金山、里斯本、哈利法克斯…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.03,0:01:13.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Voilà.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.61,0:01:14.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.61,0:01:14.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.82,0:01:17.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hang on, hang on. Do you not realize what we just did?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.82,0:01:17.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下…你没发现我们刚做了什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.58,0:01:19.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, you turned your stereo down with your laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.58,0:01:19.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有啊 你们用笔记本把音乐关小了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.08,0:01:25.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, we turned our stereo down by sending a signal around the world via the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.08,0:01:25.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我们通过网络向全球发出信号 才把音乐关小的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.21,0:01:28.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Get one of those universal remotes at RadioShack.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.21,0:01:28.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}到无线电屋买个万能遥控器就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.50,0:01:30.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're really cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.50,0:01:30.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很便宜的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.26,0:01:32.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. You don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.26,0:01:32.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 你还是不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:34.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard, enable public access.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:34.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 开启公共分享系统
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.84,0:01:36.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Public access enabled.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.84,0:01:36.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}公共分享系统开启
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.06,0:01:42.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Boy, that's terrific, but I'll see you. -No, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.06,0:01:42.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真精彩 再见 -别走 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.77,0:01:45.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[ALL GASP]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.86,0:01:47.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.86,0:01:47.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看到没？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.27,0:01:49.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.27,0:01:49.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.90,0:01:52.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Someone in Sichuan Province, China...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.90,0:01:52.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个在中国四川的网友…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:56.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is using his computer to turn our lights on and off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:56.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}正在用他的电脑控制这里的灯光
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.66,0:01:58.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Huh. Well, that's handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.66,0:01:58.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真方便啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.79,0:02:01.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, here's a question. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.79,0:02:01.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我有个疑问 干嘛多此一举？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.33,0:02:05.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ALL: Because we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.33,0:02:05.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我们做得到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.75,0:02:08.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh! They found the remote-control cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.75,0:02:08.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们发现遥控车了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.38,0:02:14.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-But wait, wait, what's on top of them? -Wireless webcams. Wave hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.38,0:02:14.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-等一下 上面那是什么东西？ -无线网络摄影机 打个招呼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.59,0:02:18.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The monster truck is out of Austin, Texas...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.59,0:02:18.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大脚车是德州奥斯汀那边控制的…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.43,0:02:22.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and the blue Viper is being operated from suburban Tel Aviv.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.43,0:02:22.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}蓝色的道奇蝰蛇是由特拉维夫城郊那里操控的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.73,0:02:26.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You may wanna put on slacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.73,0:02:26.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你最好穿上裤子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.81,0:02:28.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.81,0:02:28.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.98,0:02:34.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ew! Stop it. No. Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.98,0:02:34.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}停下 够了 别跟着我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.24,0:02:36.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR SLAMS]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.61,0:02:39.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Who's running the red Corvette? -That would be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.61,0:02:39.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谁在遥控红色雪佛兰科尔维特？ -我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:07.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, in the future, when we're disembodied brains in jars...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:07.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等未来我们的大脑脱离身体被放在罐子里的时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.56,0:03:11.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we're going to look back on this as eight hours well wasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.56,0:03:11.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们一定会觉得这八个小时完全是浪费时间
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.15,0:03:16.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't wanna be in a jar. I want my brain in an android body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.15,0:03:16.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想自己的大脑被放在罐子里 我希望它被装在机器人体内
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.78,0:03:19.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Eight feet tall and ripped.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.78,0:03:19.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}240公分高的裸男
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.20,0:03:24.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm with you. I just have to make sure if I'm a synthetic human, I'd still be Jewish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.20,0:03:24.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我同意 我只希望到时我是个合成犹太人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.46,0:03:28.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I promised my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.46,0:03:28.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我答应过我妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.08,0:03:34.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I suppose you could have your android penis circumcised.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.08,0:03:34.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想到时机器人应该也能割包皮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.51,0:03:39.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's something your rabbi would have to discuss with the manufacturer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.51,0:03:39.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的拉比可能得跟制造商讨论一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.30,0:03:43.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not to mention you'd have to power down on Saturdays.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.30,0:03:43.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且你周六还得关机
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:46.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, why is this letter in the trash?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:46.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 为什么这封信在垃圾桶里？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.35,0:03:48.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, there's always the possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.35,0:03:48.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可能是因为
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.35,0:03:51.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that a trash can spontaneously formed around the letter...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.35,0:03:51.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}信的外面长出了一个垃圾桶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.82,0:03:55.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but Ockham's Razor would suggest that someone threw it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.82,0:03:55.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是根据奥卡姆剃刀理论 应该是有人把信丢进去的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:03:57.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's from the Institute for Experimental Physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:03:57.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这信是实验物理研究所寄来的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.86,0:04:01.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They want us to present our paper on the properties of supersolids...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.86,0:04:01.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们邀请我们在玻色爱因斯坦凝聚理论
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.20,0:04:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...at the Topical Conference on Bose-Einstein Condensates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.20,0:04:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}主题研讨会上介绍我们关于超固体的论文
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.04,0:04:07.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know. I read it before I threw it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.04,0:04:07.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道 我看后才丢的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.20,0:04:10.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, if I may drill down to the bedrock of my question...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.20,0:04:10.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我想我的疑问是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.17,0:04:11.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...why did you throw it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.17,0:04:11.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你干嘛把信丢掉？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.63,0:04:15.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because I have no interest in standing in the Rose Room of the Pasadena Marriott...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.63,0:04:15.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我没兴趣在万豪酒店的玫瑰厅里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.67,0:04:18.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in front of a group of judgmental strangers...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.67,0:04:18.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在一群爱批判的陌生人前介绍论文
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.09,0:04:22.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who wouldn't recognize genius if it were standing in front of them giving a speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.09,0:04:22.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就算是天才站在他们面前演讲 他们也分辨不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.35,0:04:25.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Which, if I were there, it would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.35,0:04:25.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我去的话 就会是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.52,0:04:26.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.52,0:04:26.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这可说不好 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.73,0:04:30.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Those Topical Conference on Bose-Einstein Condensates parties are legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.73,0:04:30.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}玻色爱因斯坦凝聚理论主题研讨会的派对非常有名
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.69,0:04:32.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Forget the parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.69,0:04:32.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别想着派对了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.19,0:04:35.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Forget the parties? What a nerd.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.19,0:04:35.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别想着派对？真是个书呆子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.98,0:04:38.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Any other honors I've gotten that I don't know about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.98,0:04:38.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有什么我收到但是不知道的殊荣？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.74,0:04:41.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did UPS drop off a Nobel Prize with my name on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.74,0:04:41.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快递公司有没有送信来说我得了诺贝尔奖？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.86,0:04:45.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, don't take this the wrong way, but the day you win a Nobel Prize...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.86,0:04:45.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 这话你别往心里去 但等你拿到诺贝尔奖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.54,0:04:50.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is the day I begin my research on the drag coefficient of tassels on flying carpets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.54,0:04:50.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我都已经开始研究飞毯上流苏的牵引阻力系数了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.83,0:04:55.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ha, ha, ha. The only thing missing from that insult was your mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.83,0:04:55.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那句话再加上你妈 就更污辱人了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.67,0:04:59.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got one. Hey, Leonard, your mama's research methodology is so flawed--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.67,0:04:59.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想到一个 嘿 莱纳德 你妈的研究方法已经烂到…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.17,0:05:01.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shut up, Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.17,0:05:01.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}闭嘴 霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.43,0:05:03.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon, we have to do this. -No, we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.43,0:05:03.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 我们得去参加 -不要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.85,0:05:06.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We have to take in nourishment, expel waste...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.85,0:05:06.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们得吸入营养物 排出废物…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.22,0:05:09.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and inhale enough oxygen to keep our cells from dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.22,0:05:09.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}呼吸足够的氧气 这样细胞才不会死掉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.02,0:05:11.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everything else is optional.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.02,0:05:11.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其他的东西都不是必要的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.19,0:05:13.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, let me put it this way: I'm doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.19,0:05:13.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我换个说法吧 我要参加
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.44,0:05:15.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't. I'm the lead author.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.44,0:05:15.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行 我是主要作者
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.69,0:05:19.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, the only reason you're the lead author is because we went alphabetically.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.69,0:05:19.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 那是因为作者顺序是按首字母排的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:21.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I let you think we went alphabetically...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:21.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我让你以为是按首字母顺序排的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.74,0:05:24.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to spare you dealing with the fact that it was my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.74,0:05:24.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样你才不会因为论文是我想的而感到惭愧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.70,0:05:28.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not to put too fine a point on it, but I was throwing you a bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.70,0:05:28.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}坦白来说 是我把成就施舍给了你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.62,0:05:30.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.62,0:05:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.12,0:05:33.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, I designed the experiment that proved the hypothesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.12,0:05:33.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 是我设计整个实验成功证明理论的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.71,0:05:35.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It doesn't need proving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.71,0:05:35.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个理论不需要证明
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.29,0:05:39.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So the entire scientific community is just supposed to just take your word?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.29,0:05:39.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以整个物理界就应该相信你的话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.21,0:05:42.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're not supposed to, but they should.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.21,0:05:42.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是不因该 不过他们应该相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.13,0:05:43.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't care what you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.13,0:05:43.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不在乎你怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.51,0:05:46.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm going to the conference, presenting our findings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.51,0:05:46.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要去参加研讨会 介绍我们的研究成果
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.14,0:05:47.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I forbid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.14,0:05:47.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不准你去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.85,0:05:50.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You forbid it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.85,0:05:50.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不准我去？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.22,0:05:53.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I'm not taking credit for our work, then nobody is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.22,0:05:53.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我不去介绍我们的成果 你也不准去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.27,0:05:58.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So you admit that it's our work? -No, once again, I'm throwing you a bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.27,0:05:58.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-所以你承认这是我们的成果？ -不 再次强调 这是我施舍给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.02,0:06:00.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And once again, you are welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.02,0:06:00.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有 不用客气
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.49,0:06:03.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SCOFFS]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.61,0:06:06.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.61,0:06:06.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会吧 他太恶劣了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.87,0:06:12.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So how's it going with Sheldon? Are you guys still not talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.87,0:06:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟谢尔顿怎么样了？还在冷战吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.16,0:06:15.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not only is he still not talking to me, but he does this thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.16,0:06:15.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他不仅不跟我讲话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:18.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...where he stares at you and tries to get your brain to explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:18.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还会总瞪着我 像要把我的脑袋瞪爆炸一样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.59,0:06:23.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, like in the classic sci-fi movie Scanners?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.59,0:06:23.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有看过那部经典科幻片《夺命凶灵》吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.30,0:06:24.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like: Bzz-phew!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.30,0:06:24.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像这样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.38,0:06:27.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.38,0:06:27.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}算了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.89,0:06:29.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.89,0:06:29.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这套怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.93,0:06:33.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It says, "I know my physics, but I'm still a fun guy."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.93,0:06:34.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让大家知道“虽然我是物理学家 但我还是很风趣的”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.10,0:06:34.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.35,0:06:37.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I didn't know they still made corduroy suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.35,0:06:37.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道现在还有灯心绒西装
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.40,0:06:40.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They don't. That's why I saved this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.40,0:06:40.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是没有了 这是我特地留下来的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:43.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, let's just see what else you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:43.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的 我们看看其他衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.94,0:06:49.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, here. Take this and this and this...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.94,0:06:49.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这件、这件、这件…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.16,0:06:51.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...and these. -Is this stuff you want me to try on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.16,0:06:51.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-还有这些 -这些都要试吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.79,0:06:54.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, this is stuff I want you to throw out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.79,0:06:54.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 这些是要丢掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.66,0:06:59.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Seriously, don't even give it to charity. You won't be helping anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.66,0:06:59.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}千万别捐给慈善机构 这样不是帮他们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.13,0:07:01.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.13,0:07:01.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.09,0:07:03.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's the Bottle City of Kandor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.09,0:07:03.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是瓶中城坎多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.55,0:07:05.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.38,0:07:10.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You see, Kandor was the capital city of the planet Krypton.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.38,0:07:10.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是这样的 坎多是氪星球的首都
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.51,0:07:13.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was miniaturized by Brainiac before Krypton exploded...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.51,0:07:13.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在布莱尼亚克轰炸氪星球前被缩小
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.35,0:07:15.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and then rescued by Superman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.35,0:07:15.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后超人解救了这个城市
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.31,0:07:19.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.31,0:07:19.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.44,0:07:22.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a lot cooler when girls aren't looking at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.44,0:07:22.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}女生不注意的时候比较酷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:26.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here, why don't you put these on while I find a shirt and sport coat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:26.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}试试看这件吧 我找找衬衫跟运动外套
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:29.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Great, be right back. -Where are you going? Put them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:29.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好 我马上回来 -你要去哪？在这穿就好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.49,0:07:32.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Here? -Oh, are you shy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.49,0:07:32.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这里？ -你害羞吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.49,0:07:34.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No, I'm not shy. -Don't worry, I won't look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.49,0:07:34.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没有 我才不害羞 -别担心 我不会看的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.91,0:07:38.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know you won't. Why would you look? There's nothing to see. Not noth--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.91,0:07:38.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你不会看 干嘛要看？又没什么 也不是没有…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:41.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sweetie, put the pants on. -I'm gonna put them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:41.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-快把裤子穿上 -我马上穿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.34,0:07:45.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, you know, isn't there some way you and Sheldon could compromise...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.34,0:07:45.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟谢尔顿难道不能
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.80,0:07:47.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...on this presentation thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.80,0:07:47.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在介绍论文这件事上各退一步吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:50.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no. Scientists do not compromise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:50.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行 科学家绝不退让
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:54.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Our minds are trained to synthesize facts and come to inarguable conclusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:54.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的头脑被训练综合事实 得出不容争辩的结论
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.60,0:07:58.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not to mention, Sheldon is bat-crap crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.60,0:07:58.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且 谢尔顿根本就是个疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.65,0:08:02.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.65,0:08:02.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.27,0:08:04.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.27,0:08:04.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小心一点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.78,0:08:07.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's my original series Battlestar Galactica flight suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.78,0:08:07.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是我的《太空堡垒卡拉迪加》原版系列飞行服
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.66,0:08:10.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, why didn't you wear it on Halloween?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.66,0:08:10.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么没在万圣节穿？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.95,0:08:14.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because it's not a costume. It's a flight suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.95,0:08:14.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为这不是派对服装 这是飞行服
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.58,0:08:18.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, all right. Moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.58,0:08:18.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我继续找
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.71,0:08:21.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, wow, a paisley shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.71,0:08:21.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇哦 佩斯利图案的衬衫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.04,0:08:23.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh-huh, it goes with my corduroy suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.04,0:08:23.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是用来配我的灯芯绒西装的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.09,0:08:28.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you mean it should end up in the same place, then I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.09,0:08:28.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你的意思是这件也扔掉 我同意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.47,0:08:31.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is this your only tie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.47,0:08:31.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是你唯一的领带吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.05,0:08:33.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah, technically, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.05,0:08:33.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}理论上来说是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.01,0:08:37.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But if you'll notice, it's reversible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.01,0:08:37.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是这条领带其实可以翻过来用
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.23,0:08:40.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So it works as two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.23,0:08:40.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以其实是两条
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.06,0:08:43.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, sweetie, I don't even think it works as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.06,0:08:43.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的 我想这两面都不能用
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.32,0:08:49.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Is this all your clothes? -Yup, everything since the eighth grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.32,0:08:49.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这就是你全部的衣服了？ -对啊 我八年级后所有的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.49,0:08:51.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The eighth grade?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.49,0:08:51.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}八年级？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.11,0:08:53.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My last growth spurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.11,0:08:53.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我之后就没再长高了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.70,0:08:57.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, guess we're back to the corduroy suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.70,0:08:57.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 那还是选灯芯绒西装吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:09:00.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Great. -Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:09:00.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-太好了 -是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.21,0:09:03.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I said no. Put it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.21,0:09:03.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行 把它放下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.79,0:09:07.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KEYS JINGLING]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.84,0:09:11.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.84,0:09:11.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.34,0:09:13.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.34,0:09:13.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.93,0:09:16.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get anything good?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.93,0:09:16.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有收到什么好东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:20.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just the latest copy of Applied Particle Physics Quarterly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:20.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最新季度的《应用粒子物理学报》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.02,0:09:25.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you know, that is so weird that yours came and mine didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.02,0:09:25.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真奇怪 你的来了 我的却还没到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.07,0:09:31.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.07,0:09:31.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.53,0:09:33.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Heh-heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.95,0:09:40.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yup. Tip your waitresses. I'm here all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.95,0:09:40.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别忘了给服务生小费 我整周都在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.41,0:09:43.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To save you from further awkwardness...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.41,0:09:43.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 为了避免尴尬
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.42,0:09:47.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...know that I'm comfortable with the two of us climbing the stairs in silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.42,0:09:47.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不介意我们爬楼梯时保持沉默
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.38,0:09:50.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah, okay, me too. Zip it, lock it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.38,0:09:50.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也是 不说了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:54.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Put it in your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:54.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一句话都不会说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.39,0:10:01.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So you and Leonard-- -Oh, dear God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.39,0:10:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你跟莱纳德… -天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.60,0:10:03.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Little misunderstanding, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.60,0:10:03.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们两个有点误会？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.52,0:10:05.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A little misunderstand--?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.52,0:10:05.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有点误会？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.10,0:10:09.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Galileo and the pope had a little misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.10,0:10:09.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伽利略跟教皇之间也是有点误会
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.86,0:10:14.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, I was talking to Leonard this morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.86,0:10:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我早上跟莱纳德聊了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.16,0:10:16.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I think he feels really bad about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.16,0:10:17.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他其实情绪很低落
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:17.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.08,0:10:20.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, how do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.08,0:10:20.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.74,0:10:23.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't understand the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.74,0:10:23.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不太懂你的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.66,0:10:27.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I'm just asking if it's difficult to be fighting with your best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.66,0:10:27.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是问你会不会觉得跟好朋友吵架很难过
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.63,0:10:30.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I hadn't thought about it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.63,0:10:30.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没这样想过
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.59,0:10:33.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wonder if I've been experiencing physiological manifestations...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.59,0:10:33.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是在想我最近情绪起伏太大
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:37.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of some sort of unconscious emotional turmoil.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:37.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是不是影响到了我的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.55,0:10:38.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.55,0:10:38.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下 你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.76,0:10:41.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I couldn't poop this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.76,0:10:41.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我今早便秘了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.14,0:10:48.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You should just talk to him. I'm sure you guys can work this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.14,0:10:48.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你应该去找他谈 一定会没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.36,0:10:51.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It's certainly preferable to my plan. -Which was?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.36,0:10:51.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这个比我的计划好 -你的计划是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.61,0:10:54.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A powerful laxative.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.61,0:10:54.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}强力泻药
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.16,0:10:57.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, so you absolutely should talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.16,0:10:57.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 你真的应该跟他谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.28,0:10:59.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know Leonard values you as a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.28,0:10:59.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道莱纳德把你当很好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.24,0:11:01.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He told me without your little idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.24,0:11:01.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说如果不是你的小点子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.29,0:11:05.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...there was no way he could've come up with this whole experiment thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.29,0:11:05.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他也做不出实验
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:09.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me. Little idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:09.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 小点子？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.79,0:11:13.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, he tried to explain it to me. I didn't really understand it--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.79,0:11:13.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯 他有跟我解释 可是我听不太懂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.01,0:11:16.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course you didn't. He said "little idea"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.01,0:11:16.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你当然不会懂 他说“小点子”？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.13,0:11:19.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Well, no. I mean, not in those words--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.13,0:11:19.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 他不是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.34,0:11:21.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In what words, then, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.34,0:11:21.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那他是怎么说的？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.39,0:11:23.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The exact words aren't really--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.39,0:11:23.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他原话怎么说的不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.06,0:11:25.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It's more the spirit in which-- -What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.06,0:11:25.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-重点是他的心意… -他到底怎么说的？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.60,0:11:27.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You had a lucky hunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.60,0:11:27.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说是你侥幸有了那个直觉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.31,0:11:31.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've been thinking. Instead of arguing about this, why--?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.31,0:11:31.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我们与其再吵下去 我们为何不…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.23,0:11:34.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't you ever speak to me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.23,0:11:34.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要再跟我说话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.49,0:11:37.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What--?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.49,0:11:37.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.66,0:11:41.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, he:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.66,0:11:41.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他这个人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.25,0:11:53.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I'm leaving for the conference.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.25,0:11:53.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 我要出发去研讨会了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.76,0:11:58.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Have fun presenting my "lucky hunch." -Sheldon, I didn't mean it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.76,0:11:58.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-祝你顺利介绍我侥幸想到的论文 -谢尔顿 我不是那个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.09,0:11:59.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why did you say it? -I don't know--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.09,0:11:59.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那你为什么要那样说？ -我不知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.89,0:12:02.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Were you trying to impress Penny? -No, no, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.89,0:12:02.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你是想讨好佩妮吗？ -不 不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.85,0:12:04.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.85,0:12:04.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有一点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.85,0:12:06.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How did that work out for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.85,0:12:06.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你成功了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.85,0:12:08.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.85,0:12:08.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 可以出发了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.27,0:12:11.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Libido, one. Truth, zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.27,0:12:11.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有异性没人性
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.32,0:12:14.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna ask one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.32,0:12:14.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我再问你一次
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.78,0:12:17.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We did the work together, let's present the paper together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.78,0:12:17.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个论文是我们合作的成果 跟我一起去介绍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.65,0:12:22.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I'm telling you for the last time, it's pandering, it's undignified, and bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.65,0:12:22.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我最后一次告诉你 我不做这种逢迎又贬低自己的事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.45,0:12:25.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.45,0:12:25.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.87,0:12:28.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Bye, Sheldon. -Goodbye, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.87,0:12:28.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-再见 谢尔顿 -再见 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.13,0:12:38.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[GRUNTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:41.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One of these days: Phew!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:41.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总有一天会成功的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.01,0:12:45.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.01,0:12:45.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.22,0:12:47.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right, this side does look better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.22,0:12:47.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说得对 这面确实比较好看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.27,0:12:50.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, I didn't say better, I said less stained.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.27,0:12:50.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有说比较好看 我说的是这一面比较干净
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.85,0:12:55.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just checked the house. There's probably 20, 25 people in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.85,0:12:55.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚看过了 里面大概有20到25人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.11,0:12:56.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You're kidding. -Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.11,0:12:56.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你少开玩笑了 -人就只有这些？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.73,0:13:00.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All? In particle physics, 25 is Woodstock.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.73,0:13:00.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只有这些？在粒子物理这个领域 有25人参加就很了不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.70,0:13:04.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Well, then, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.70,0:13:04.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.49,0:13:06.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wasn't expecting such a crowd. I'm nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.49,0:13:06.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没想到会有这么多人 我现在好紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.83,0:13:11.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It's okay. Open with a joke, you'll be fine. -Okay, joke. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.83,0:13:11.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-别紧张 进去先说个笑话吧 -好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.29,0:13:13.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about this? Um, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.29,0:13:13.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个笑话怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.92,0:13:17.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's this farmer, and he has these chickens...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.92,0:13:17.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有个农夫养了一些鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.26,0:13:18.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but they won't lay any eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.26,0:13:18.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是他的鸡不会下蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:21.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So he calls a physicist to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:21.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以他打电话给物理学家求救
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.76,0:13:26.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The physicist then does some calculations and he says:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.76,0:13:26.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}物理学家做了些计算 然后说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:32.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"I have a solution, but it only works for spherical chickens in a vacuum."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:32.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“我知道如何解决 不过只能用在真空状态的球状鸡身上”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.77,0:13:34.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[ALL LAUGHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.40,0:13:36.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.40,0:13:36.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好笑吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.61,0:13:43.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, sorry, I just-- I've heard it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.61,0:13:43.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 我…我听过这个笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.03,0:13:45.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Let's roll. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.03,0:13:45.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-进去吧 -好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.24,0:13:48.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, nice suit. -It's a classic, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.24,0:13:48.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这套西装真好看 -很典雅吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.41,0:13:51.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I really should've brought my own car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.41,0:13:51.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真该自己开车来的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.46,0:13:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So in conclusion, the data show that at temperatures approaching absolute zero...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.46,0:13:58.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结论就是 当温度接近绝对零度时
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:14:01.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the moment of inertia changes and the solid becomes a supersolid...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:14:01.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}惯性会改变 固体就会变成超固体
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.63,0:14:06.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which clearly appears to be a previously unknown state of matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.63,0:14:06.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这显然是一项新发现
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.64,0:14:08.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[AUDIENCE APPLAUDING]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.68,0:14:10.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.68,0:14:10.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:16.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Are there any questions? MAN: Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:16.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-请问各位有问题吗？ -我有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.11,0:14:19.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.11,0:14:19.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}刚才你到底在胡说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.49,0:14:22.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Any other questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.49,0:14:22.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有其他问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.24,0:14:27.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Sheldon Cooper here. I am the lead author of this particular paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.24,0:14:27.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是谢尔顿库珀博士 这篇论文的主要作者
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.45,0:14:31.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.45,0:14:31.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.16,0:14:35.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you, sir, you have completely skipped over the part...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.16,0:14:35.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而你 先生 你完全没提到
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.00,0:14:37.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...where I was walking through the park...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.00,0:14:37.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在公园散步
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.08,0:14:39.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I saw these children on a merry-go-round...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.08,0:14:39.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看到在玩旋转木马的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:42.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which started me thinking about the moment of inertia...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:42.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们让我想到像氮这种气体
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.38,0:14:45.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in gasses like helium at temperatures approaching absolute zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.38,0:14:45.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在接近绝对零度时的惯性
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.64,0:14:48.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't skip it. It's just an anecdote. It's not science.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.64,0:14:48.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有故意略过这一段 那只是趣闻 不是论文重点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.47,0:14:51.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I see. It was the apple falling on Newton's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.47,0:14:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？这就像牛顿被苹果砸到一样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.64,0:14:53.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Was that just an anecdote?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.64,0:14:53.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这也一点都不重要吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.06,0:14:55.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You are not Isaac Newton. -No, no, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.06,0:14:55.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你又不是艾萨克牛顿 -我的确不是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.44,0:14:58.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gravity would have been apparent to me without the apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.44,0:14:58.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就算没有苹果砸到我的头 我也知道重力是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.36,0:15:00.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You cannot be that arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.36,0:15:00.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你也太自大了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.11,0:15:02.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You continue to underestimate me, my good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.11,0:15:02.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就继续低估我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:07.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you weren't happy with my presentation, then maybe you should've given it with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:07.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你不满意我的介绍 那你应该跟我一起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.03,0:15:11.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As I've explained repeatedly, unlike you, I don't need validation from lesser minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.03,0:15:11.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说过很多次了 我不需要比我笨的人给我肯定
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.41,0:15:13.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No offense. -Really? So why did you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.41,0:15:13.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不是针对你们 -是吗？那你来这里干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.91,0:15:16.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Because I knew you'd screw this up. -I didn't screw it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.91,0:15:16.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-因为我知道你一定会搞砸 -我才没有搞砸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.79,0:15:20.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, please. I admit, that spherical-chicken joke was hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.79,0:15:20.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 那个球状鸡的笑话是很好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.13,0:15:22.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Thank you. -It was straight downhill from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.13,0:15:22.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢谢 -可从那之后就直线下降
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.55,0:15:24.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've had enough of your condescension.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.55,0:15:24.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我受够了你的侮辱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.67,0:15:27.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe I didn't go to college when I was 11, like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.67,0:15:27.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许我不像你一样11岁就上大学
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.55,0:15:31.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe I got my doctorate at 24 instead of 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.55,0:15:31.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我24岁才拿到博士学位 不像你16岁就拿到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.06,0:15:35.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you are not the only person who is smarter than everyone else in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.06,0:15:35.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但不是只有你比在场的人都聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.56,0:15:37.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.56,0:15:37.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有针对你们
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.77,0:15:41.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I am clearly not the only person who is tormented by insecurity...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.77,0:15:41.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这世上也不是只有我被不安全感折磨
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.90,0:15:44.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and has an ego in need of constant validation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.90,0:15:44.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且很自我 需要别人不断地肯定
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.32,0:15:47.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So you admit you're an egotist. -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.32,0:15:47.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-所以你承认你很自我 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.11,0:15:51.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My name is Dr. Leonard Hofstadter. I could never please my parents...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.11,0:15:51.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是莱纳德霍夫斯塔特博士 我永远得不到父母的肯定
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.49,0:15:53.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so I need to get my self-esteem from strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.49,0:15:53.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我得靠陌生人给我自信
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.91,0:15:55.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But he's worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.91,0:15:55.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是他更糟糕！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.16,0:15:56.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, that is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.16,0:15:56.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}行了 别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:15:58.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:15:58.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}够了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.42,0:16:03.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You cannot blow up my head with your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.42,0:16:03.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不可能用念力轰掉我的脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.13,0:16:05.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then I'll settle for an aneurism.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.13,0:16:05.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让你得动脉瘤也好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.26,0:16:07.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Stop it. -You hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.26,0:16:07.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-快停止 -你居然打我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.18,0:16:08.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You saw that. He hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.18,0:16:08.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们都看到了 他打我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.59,0:16:11.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You tried to blow up my head. -So it was working.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.59,0:16:11.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你想轰掉我脑袋 -所以这方法是有效的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.10,0:16:13.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It wasn't-- It was not-- You are a nutcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.10,0:16:13.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是…不…你这个疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.35,0:16:16.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll see. Heads up, you people in the front row. This is a splash zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.35,0:16:16.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这可说不定 前排的人小心了 你们处在浪溅区
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.85,0:16:18.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stop it. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.85,0:16:18.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快停下…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.94,0:16:20.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Quit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.94,0:16:20.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快停下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.06,0:16:24.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[BOTH GRUNTING]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.65,0:16:28.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is this usually how these physics things go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.65,0:16:28.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}物理研讨会都是这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.45,0:16:31.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}More often than you'd think.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.45,0:16:31.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比你想的还要糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:35.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hit you with a Vulcan nerve pinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:35.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要用火神钳掐死你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.12,0:16:36.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No pinches. No--! -No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.12,0:16:37.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不许这样 不… -不！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.75,0:16:38.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LOCK CLICKING]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.30,0:16:49.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You could have offered me a ride home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.30,0:16:49.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以载我回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.97,0:16:52.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're lucky I didn't run you over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.97,0:16:52.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没把你碾死算你走运了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.80,0:16:55.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't understand what you're unhappy about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.80,0:16:55.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不懂你在气什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.06,0:16:58.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You begged me to come, I came. There's just no pleasing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.06,0:16:58.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你求我去 我就去了 你真是难伺候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.73,0:17:01.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right. I'm the problem, the one that needs help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.73,0:17:01.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 问题都在我身上 我需要帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.52,0:17:04.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that's not much of an apology, but I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.52,0:17:04.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然这不太算是道歉 不过我愿意接受
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.82,0:17:06.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.82,0:17:06.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.98,0:17:10.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is there anything you'd like to apologize for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.98,0:17:10.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有什么要跟我道歉的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.82,0:17:12.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.82,0:17:12.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.41,0:17:15.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry I tried to blow up your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.41,0:17:15.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很抱歉我想轰掉你的脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.66,0:17:18.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was uncalled for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.66,0:17:18.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根本没那个必要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.08,0:17:20.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You won't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.08,0:17:20.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们不会相信这件事的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.33,0:17:23.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Somebody got the whole thing on their cell phone and put it on YouTube.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.33,0:17:23.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人用手机把你们的争吵录下来 放到YouTube上了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.13,0:17:25.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.13,0:17:25.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.42,0:17:29.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Now, who would do that? -That would be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.42,0:17:29.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谁会做这种事？ -我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:32.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Check it out. It's a featured video.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:32.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快来看看 还被放到精选视频里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.34,0:17:34.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You hit me. You saw that. He hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.34,0:17:34.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你居然打我 你们都看到了 他打我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.18,0:17:36.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You tried to blow up my head. -So it was working.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.18,0:17:36.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你想轰掉我脑袋 -所以这方法是有效的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.60,0:17:39.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It was not-- You are a nutcase. -We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.60,0:17:39.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不是…你这个疯子 -这可说不定
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.31,0:17:43.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You people in the front row, heads up. This is a splash zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.31,0:17:43.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}前排的人小心了 你们处在浪溅区
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.44,0:17:47.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stop it. Quit it. Quit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.44,0:17:47.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}停下 快停下…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.90,0:17:49.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[BOTH GRUNTING]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.53,0:17:53.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hit you with a Vulcan nerve pinch. -No pinches. No--!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.53,0:17:53.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我要用火神钳掐死你 -不许这样 不…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.45,0:17:56.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You should clip your fingernails. Those hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.45,0:17:56.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你该剪指甲了 疼死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.49,0:17:58.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.49,0:17:58.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.20,0:18:00.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does this suit really look that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.20,0:18:00.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这套西装这么难看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.83,0:18:02.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Forget your suit. Look at my arms waving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.83,0:18:02.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的西装算什么 你看我挥手臂的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.87,0:18:05.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm like a flamingo on Ritalin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.87,0:18:05.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就像只吃了利他林的火烈鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.59,0:18:10.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard, would you like to explain to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.59,0:18:10.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 快告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.09,0:18:14.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...why your Facebook page has a picture of me sleeping on your shoulder captioned:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.09,0:18:14.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么你在脸书上发布了我靠在你肩头睡觉的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.05,0:18:15.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Me and my girlfriend"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.05,0:18:15.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还写着“我跟我女朋友”？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.05,0:18:20.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh-oh, here comes the talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.05,0:18:20.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她来兴师问罪了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.52,0:18:31.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-He hit me. -You tried to blow up my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.52,0:18:30.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你们都看到了 他打我 -你想轰掉我脑袋
