Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.32,0:18:35.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.32,0:18:35.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}浑蛋东西嘛
